# Solo Dev Cycle (Insite)

- Follow personal skill `solo-dev-harness` **SOP.md** for the whole cycle (not NOW-only).
- Milestone gate: read `documentation/NOW.md`, then `AGENTS.md` § Current Delivery Status and `documentation/ROADMAP.md` before planning.
- Session continuity: `documentation/NOW.md` is the git-tracked pick-up file — overwrite at teardown; do not rely on Cursor chat.
- **Dual-write:** SOP improvements update (1) `~/.cursor/skills/solo-dev-harness/SOP.md`, (2) `templates/`, (3) this repo’s matching files. Insite-only law stays in `.cursor/skills/insite-dev/`.
- Cursor SoT for project law: `.cursor/rules/`. `.trae/` is legacy read-only during migration.
- Testing mindset: read `TESTING_STRATEGY.md`; Maestro via `scripts/maestro/run-local.sh` only.
- User-visible mobile/nav/upload/task changes require QA path; logic-only may stop at Test Engineer.
- UI change reports: include visual artifacts + delta explanation (see `.cursor/rules/ui-visual-report.mdc`).
- Before Maestro or release claims, run `npm run dev:doctor`.
- Workflow checklists: `.cursor/rules/workflow-solo.md` (default), `workflow-feature.md`, `workflow-bugfix.md`, `workflow-release.md`, `workflow-ms02-unblock.md`.
- Multi-critique + form interaction gates: `.cursor/rules/multi-critique-validation.mdc` (plan ≥2 critiques; validation ≥1; headed TextField smoke).
- Maestro 8-gate preflight: `.cursor/rules/maestro-preflight.md`.

## Concurrent development (default)

- Orchestrator **prefers concurrent tracks** when ownership partitions (disjoint files / P## cases / idle-parallel milestones).
- Cap Maestro at **≤2** distinct sim UDIDs on this machine; **1 job per UDID**.
- **Two-sim SOP:** parallel Maestro is allowed only on **two different UDIDs** (export `MAESTRO_UDID` per track before launch). Same UDID + two jobs = XCTest/FlyingFox death. One sim is the default when UDIDs are not claimed.
- Independent Maestro cases while iterating (not full suites): `scripts/maestro/run-create-task-photo-one.sh P##` and `scripts/maestro/run-update-progress-photo-one.sh U##`; full suites = final gate only.
- Shared helpers / product SoT / Photos `FORCE_PURGE` = single-writer; sync then re-run affected cases.
- Details: `.cursor/skills/insite-dev/SKILL.md` § Concurrent development + `solo-dev-harness` workflows.md.

## Git push default (solo)

- After a successful **user-requested** commit, push to the tracked remote by default (`git push` / `git push -u origin HEAD` if needed).
- Skip push only if the user says not to, if push would require force, or if auth fails (then report the blocker).
- Never force-push to main/master; never update git config; never echo secrets or credential-bearing remote URLs.
